  "summary_en": "Korea's Last-Mile Logistics Industry Development Act (as amended Dec. 2025) regulates package delivery registration and small-package delivery certification, worker protection, and industry promotion. Drones and outdoor mobile (delivery) robots are included as delivery means, with registration requiring operation safety certification under the Intelligent Robots Act.",
  "key_provisions_or_claims": [
   "Defines small package delivery to include drones and outdoor mobile robots (Art. 2).",
   "Registration for drone/outdoor robot delivery requires aviation registration or Intelligent Robots Act operation safety certification (Art. 5(1)3).",
   "Certification of small package delivery agents, with insurance, driving licence, and safety education verification for workers.",
   "Standard contracts, renewal and termination protections for delivery workers.",
   "Master plan every five years, pilot projects, tax and financial support for the industry."
  ],
